[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; DRONE CARRIER PACK — a flat case with two Divers folded into it.
;
; Read as a THING YOU THROW, not a thing you wear: it leaves your hand and
; bursts, so the silhouette is a case with a seam down it and two rotor humps
; showing through the lid, which is what tells the player what comes out.
;
; Palette is the guns' olive/steel/black plus the Diver's red hubs, so the
; canister and the drones inside it are visibly the same kit.

